new area to explore, with new obstacles and challenges to work your way through.There are plenty of new things to crash into, fall off and generally make a mess of while trying to make it to the end.HorsesYou can now ride horses in Skate Mates.Each skate controls part of the horse, so you’ll need to work together to actually steer it. It can get pretty chaotic when both players aren't on the same page.Unlock Every Clothing ItemYou can now unlock and try out every clo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T22:14:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394751","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4549600-1840310314352859","game_id":"steam-4549600","kind":"announcement","title":"🐴 NEW: Rideable Horses Are Here!","summary":"Think you’ve mastered the art of controlling two skates at once?Think again.Skate Mates now has horses, and they completely change how you play.Mount a horse and your skates become responsible for controlling it. Instead of simply skating through the course, you’ll need to work together with your teammate to steer the horse, avoid obstacles, and make it to the finish.🐴 Two Skates. One Horse. Zero Coordination.When you’re riding a horse, each skate controls a different direction.Buck with the lef","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T00:52:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352859","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4549600-1839041357030872","game_id":"steam-4549600","kind":"announcement","title":"Skate Mates Demo 2.0 is here!","summary":"A major update for the Skate Mates Demo is now live, bringing improvements across multiplayer, visuals, performance, customisation, and overall gameplay polish.Based on player feedback, this update focuses on making the demo smoother, more stable, and more enjoyable from start to finish.Improved Online MultiplayerThe networking system has received significant improvements, resulting in a smoother online experience.Improved player synchronisationReduced desyncs and jitterMore responsive movementI","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T22:38:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030872","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4549600-1831432155576408","game_id":"steam-4549600","kind":"announcement","title":"Controller Support Now Available!","summary":"Good morning/afternoon/everything in between. A great milestone reached today, we not have controller support for Skate Mates!It actually feels great, kind of feels like it should be a console game with how it feels. Everything aligns perfectly. Left SkateRight SkateLeft Trigger: PushRight Trigger: PushLeft Bumper: BrakeRight Bumper: BrakeLeft Stick: MovementRight Stick: MovementAdd the rest buttons and away we go. Full controller support!Now local multiplayer on one controller might be somethin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T00:57:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155576408","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4549600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4549600":"2026-10-26T02:53:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4549600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:43Z"